@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 05 - Payment Failure or Timeout Rollback

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Web / Mobile Client" as Client
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Reservation Service" as Reservation
database "Redis" as Redis
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Message Broker" as Broker

Customer -> Client: Start checkout but payment fails or times out

alt Payment failed
    Payment -> DB: Update payment status to FAILED
    DB --> Payment: Payment updated
    Payment -> Reservation: Cancel reservation
    Reservation -> Redis: Delete seat lock key
    Redis --> Reservation: Lock removed
    Reservation -> DB: Update reservation to CANCELLED
    DB --> Reservation: Reservation cancelled
    Reservation -> Broker: Publish ReservationCancelled event
else Reservation TTL expired
    Reservation -> Redis: Seat lock expires automatically
    Redis --> Reservation: Lock removed by TTL
    Reservation -> DB: Update reservation to EXPIRED
    DB --> Reservation: Reservation expired
    Reservation -> Broker: Publish ReservationExpired event
end

Reservation --> Client: Seat released
Client --> Customer: Show failure or timeout message

@enduml
